{
  "description": "The zone summary in records/get, records/add and records/update is written by WriteZoneInfoAsJson in DnsServerCore/WebServiceZonesApi.cs (v15.5.0). It always writes name, type, lastModified, disabled and soaSerial, writes catalog as null for zones outside a catalog, and adds DNSSEC, expiry and notify members by zone type. The examples in APIDOCS.md show internal, which 15.5.0 no longer writes; it stays optional. Confirmed with strict response validation of records/get, records/add and records/update against Technitium 15.5.0, 15.5.1 and 15.6.2 containers on 2026-10-31.",
